837-f099-4284-9c88-eb3368182f9f" contextRef="C_290e2764-f463-4e36-aa04-21af9f21b6a8" name="bcic:PercentageOfQualifyingAssetsToTotalAssets" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">70</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">% of our total assets. As of </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">June 30, 2026, qualifying assets represe</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">nt </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_fe5bbd6c-94bc-4db3-9c3f-41d0f384f5d2" contextRef="C_af2b9712-cf94-4a94-b306-6f7e6e219fbb" name="bcic:PercentageOfQualifyingAssetsToTotalAssets" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">85.6</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">%</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> of t</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">he Company's total assets and non-qualifying assets represent </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_f4207889-dd1b-404a-a180-934c85bc4759" contextRef="C_af2b9712-cf94-4a94-b306-6f7e6e219fbb" name="bcic:NonQualifiedAssetsPercentageOfTotalAssets" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">14.4</ix:nonFraction>