.333%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(22)</span><div style="display:inline;"><ix:footnote id="FNT_d045ed9d-be91-46af-a4db-4b54e6fb6669" xml:lang="en-US"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">This investment is owned by PTMN Sub Holdings LLC, one of the Company&#8217;s taxable blocker subsidiaries.</span></ix:footnote></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:6pt;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.333%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(23)</span><div style="display:inline;"><ix:footnote id="FNT_2551d1c7-d4e5-486d-b308-cbbc8638aa70" xml:lang="en-US"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">All debt investments are income producing, unless otherwise noted. Equity and warrant investments are non-income producing, unless otherwise noted.</span></ix:footnote></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:6pt;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.333%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(24)</span><div style="display:inline;"><ix:footnote id="FNT_bd867c03-f6ba-4c20-8cdc-56b62af55bbe" xml:lang="en-US"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Percentages are based on net assets as of </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">December 31, 2025</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">.</span></ix:footnote></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:6pt;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.333%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(25)</span><div style="display:inline;"><ix:footnote id="FNT_4e9b15df-9e26-46eb-a069-4de0c2ddd03c" xml:lang="en-US"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The equity investment is income producing.</span></ix:footnote></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:6pt;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.333%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(26)</span><div style="display:inline;"><ix:footnote id="FNT_a7aea7df-30df-424b-9321-93947261f040" xml:lang="en-US"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The investment is held at the net asset value (&#8220;NAV&#8221;) of the underlying fund.</span></ix:footnote></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:6pt;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.333%;word-break:keep-