         <td style="padding-top:0.01in;text-indent:10pt;white-space:pre-wrap;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:bottom;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0.01in;text-align:left;"><p style="margin-left:1.853%;text-indent:0;font-size:8pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;Average stated interest rate</span></p></td>
